        "id": "AC1",
        "text": "A booking must name Atlas, Borealis or Cosmos and a non-blank owner, start on the hour or half hour UTC, and last 30–240 minutes in 30-minute steps; otherwise book() rejects with a BookingError saying why",
        "derived": false
      },
      {
        "id": "AC2",
        "text": "A booking overlapping another of the same room is rejected; different rooms never clash; a booking may start exactly when another ends",
        "derived": false
      },
      {
        "id": "AC3",
        "text": "list(room) returns that room's bookings ordered by start time",
        "derived": false
      },
      {
